   "title": "Start here",
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Krea 2 - LoRA training set\n\nBuilds a training set for a character LoRA (for example for MiniMax H3 talking-head videos): **24 images of the same person** with a caption .txt each.\n\n1. **Load Reference** (stage 1): a clear photo of the person.\n2. Set your **trigger word** in Prompt List > `caption_prefix` (default `zxq person,`).\n3. **Run** once. Images + captions go to `ComfyUI/output/krea2_dataset/<folder_name>/` as `image_0001.png` + `image_0001.txt`, the layout ai-toolkit, kohya and diffusion-pipe read.\n\n**Check every image** in the contact sheet and delete the ones where the face drifted before training: a LoRA learns its mistakes too.\n\n**Red nodes are the ones you set.** Stages run left to right with a note under each.\n\nFull instructions: https://github.com/tenitsky/krea2-image"
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
