    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "title": "About sampling",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 4. Sampling\n\nKrea 2 Turbo's settings: **8 steps, CFG 1, euler / simple**. CFG 1 means the negative prompt is not used (it is zeroed, as in Comfy-Org's templates).\n\n**Size**: 1024 x 1024 by default. Other good sizes: 832 x 1216 (portrait), 1216 x 832, 1344 x 768 (landscape), 768 x 1344."
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
