   "title": "About stage 3",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 3. The reference\n\nThe portrait goes to Krea 2 twice, as in Comfy-Org's reference template: the Qwen3-VL text encoder **sees** it (picture 1), and the VAE-encoded image joins as a **reference latent**. Each prompt then says how to show the same person.\n\nIdentity holds best when the reference is sharp, evenly lit and shows the face clearly. Expect some drift on extreme angles (profiles, back): check the set and re-run single lines with another seed."
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
